  "bio": "Mary Smiles, a seasoned tattoo artist based in Portland, United States, is renowned for her impeccable cleanliness, which she upholds with the utmost diligence in her creative space at 13 Moons Tattoo Studio. Specializing in fineline, illustrative, and geometric styles, her studio is not only a beacon of artistic excellence but also a haven of hygiene, assuring clients a safe and pristine environment for their tattoo journey.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Portland, Maine, United States"
